WEBVTT

01:38.240 --> 01:41.070
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.120 --> 01:43.910
[Episode 27]

01:49.070 --> 01:49.680
I lost.

01:50.479 --> 01:51.920
Your Go skills are impressive.

01:51.920 --> 01:53.450
Better than your father's.

01:53.789 --> 01:54.920
To be honest, Uncle,

01:55.150 --> 01:56.479
when I was at home before,

01:56.479 --> 01:58.740
my father didn't dare to play against me.

02:01.640 --> 02:02.200
Banxia.

02:03.070 --> 02:03.800
You're back.

02:04.920 --> 02:06.180
I need your help with something.

02:06.180 --> 02:07.240
What is it? Tell me.

02:10.560 --> 02:11.590
It's getting into autumn these days.

02:11.590 --> 02:12.910
The weather is turning cooler.

02:12.910 --> 02:15.170
I want to buy some fabric to make clothes.

02:15.240 --> 02:16.560
But the East Market is too far.

02:16.560 --> 02:17.890
I don't have a carriage.

02:18.150 --> 02:18.800
That's simple.

02:18.800 --> 02:19.710
My carriage is right outside.

02:19.710 --> 02:20.430
I'll take you there.

02:20.430 --> 02:20.730
Let's go.

02:20.730 --> 02:21.190
Wait.

02:22.560 --> 02:23.020
Banxia.

02:23.430 --> 02:24.430
It's time for dinner.

02:24.430 --> 02:25.590
If you need to buy something,

02:25.590 --> 02:26.790
go tomorrow instead.

02:26.820 --> 02:28.500
No, I must go today.

02:31.140 --> 02:32.000
Father, if you think

02:32.000 --> 02:33.730
you'll have no one to dine with,

02:33.800 --> 02:35.680
you can go next door to find Physician Jiu.

02:35.680 --> 02:37.120
After all, he rendered great help to you.

02:37.120 --> 02:38.850
It's good for you to get closer.

02:38.910 --> 02:39.710
That's right.

02:39.710 --> 02:40.840
Xuanye is easygoing.

02:40.840 --> 02:42.030
He's easy to get along with.

02:42.030 --> 02:43.240
You're neighbors.

02:43.870 --> 02:45.870
It's good to visit each other often.

02:49.870 --> 02:50.590
Well then...

02:50.590 --> 02:51.000
Let's go.

02:51.000 --> 02:51.329
Okay.

02:54.240 --> 02:54.750
Young Master,

02:54.750 --> 02:55.430
where do you want to go?

02:55.430 --> 02:56.400
To the East Market.

02:56.400 --> 02:57.560
To buy fabric with Banxia.

02:57.560 --> 02:57.960
Got it.

02:58.710 --> 02:59.960
It's just to buy fabric.

02:59.960 --> 03:02.560
We don't need others to keep us company, right?

03:03.710 --> 03:04.800
Can you drive the carriage?

03:04.800 --> 03:05.400
Yes, I can.

03:05.540 --> 03:07.070
Then let's go by ourselves.

03:08.560 --> 03:09.890
Of course, that's fine.

03:09.960 --> 03:10.910
You wait here.

03:11.750 --> 03:12.430
Got it.

03:12.710 --> 03:13.170
Banxia.

03:26.050 --> 03:26.680
Banxia.

03:28.750 --> 03:29.430
Xuanye.

03:33.630 --> 03:34.690
Are we going or not?

03:35.150 --> 03:36.060
We're leaving now.

03:36.060 --> 03:37.260
Let's catch up later.

03:54.680 --> 03:55.150
Xuanye.

03:55.890 --> 03:56.680
Do you know what's going on

03:56.680 --> 03:57.940
with Banxia recently?

03:58.030 --> 03:59.070
She's ignoring me

03:59.630 --> 04:00.360
and doesn't invite me to her house

04:00.360 --> 04:02.090
to eat delicious food anymore.

04:04.910 --> 04:06.080
That Mr. Li just now,

04:06.520 --> 04:07.190
he said before

04:07.190 --> 04:08.750
that he's Banxia's fiancé.

04:09.910 --> 04:10.560
Xuanye,

04:11.520 --> 04:12.360
I thought you two

04:12.360 --> 04:13.240
were a couple.

04:17.040 --> 04:17.720
Well, if Banxia

04:17.720 --> 04:19.040
marries someone else,

04:19.230 --> 04:20.089
does that mean I won't be able to eat

04:20.089 --> 04:20.950
the delicious food she makes anymore?

04:20.950 --> 04:22.150
Stop talking so much.

04:23.120 --> 04:24.050
Get back to work.

04:47.870 --> 04:48.430
Xuanye,

04:49.000 --> 04:50.530
are you sure this will work?

04:51.870 --> 04:53.470
We'll only know after we try.

04:54.010 --> 04:55.480
After all, this is just a formula

04:55.480 --> 04:56.490
guessed by smell.

04:56.800 --> 04:58.130
I'm not certain either.

04:59.560 --> 05:00.480
These are all the things

05:00.480 --> 05:02.140
I smelled at his place before.

05:02.560 --> 05:04.000
Perhaps this is the

05:04.000 --> 05:05.330
key to this magic spell.

05:06.440 --> 05:07.430
What kind of magic spell is this?

05:07.430 --> 05:08.430
It's so powerful.

05:09.680 --> 05:11.120
I heard before

05:11.830 --> 05:12.760
that some demons

05:13.360 --> 05:14.820
can use secret techniques

05:14.920 --> 05:16.580
to share others' five senses.

05:17.370 --> 05:19.070
But as to exchanging five senses

05:19.070 --> 05:21.040
and controlling the other's body like this,

05:21.040 --> 05:22.970
this is the first time I've seen it.

05:25.240 --> 05:26.270
Let's give it a try.

05:26.270 --> 05:26.800
We can't let him

05:26.800 --> 05:28.270
lead us by the nose anymore.

05:28.270 --> 05:28.730
Chi Xue,

05:28.950 --> 05:30.240
help me set up a formation in a moment.

05:30.240 --> 05:30.570
Okay.

05:30.960 --> 05:32.230
[Heal and Help]

05:58.830 --> 06:02.390
Jia corresponds to Zhen (the East), and Yi corresponds to Li (the South).

06:02.390 --> 06:04.390
All spirits return to their origin.

06:06.680 --> 06:07.240
Go!

07:22.780 --> 07:23.370
Xuanye?

07:33.600 --> 07:34.360
Who are you?

07:36.920 --> 07:38.050
Who exactly are you?

07:40.920 --> 07:41.980
If you don't speak,

07:42.240 --> 07:44.170
don't blame me for being impolite!

07:45.860 --> 07:46.790
You? Seriously?

08:24.430 --> 08:25.490
What are you doing?

08:28.270 --> 08:28.870
Leave now.

08:29.280 --> 08:30.080
I said leave.

08:31.160 --> 08:32.020
Physician Jiu?

08:34.270 --> 08:35.039
I've set up a formation

08:35.039 --> 08:36.710
and switched identities with him.

08:36.710 --> 08:37.630
Time is limited.

08:37.630 --> 08:38.830
You need to leave now.

08:41.440 --> 08:42.200
Leave.

09:15.360 --> 09:16.070
Xuanye,

09:16.200 --> 09:17.260
come back quickly.

09:17.400 --> 09:18.730
I can't hold on anymore.

09:36.870 --> 09:37.440
Xuanye.

09:39.440 --> 09:40.000
Chi Xue,

09:40.710 --> 09:41.510
what's wrong?

10:19.390 --> 10:19.870
Xuanye.

10:20.630 --> 10:22.630
That demon refused to say anything.

10:23.180 --> 10:24.150
In the Hundred Demon Catalog,

10:24.150 --> 10:26.150
there's no relevant record either.

10:26.390 --> 10:27.790
However, I can sense that

10:28.110 --> 10:30.440
this demon's cultivation is not shallow.

10:31.750 --> 10:32.610
Is he dead then?

10:33.030 --> 10:33.670
I sealed

10:33.670 --> 10:35.600
the eight major acupoints in his body.

10:35.600 --> 10:37.120
If he forcibly breaks through,

10:37.120 --> 10:38.720
he will be severely injured.

10:39.120 --> 10:40.480
Moreover, before I left,

10:40.480 --> 10:41.550
I had set a big fire.

10:42.120 --> 10:43.720
It's unlikely he can escape.

10:43.830 --> 10:45.090
It's still not secure.

10:45.510 --> 10:47.840
You should have killed him with one sword strike.

10:47.840 --> 10:49.900
Our spiritual senses were connected at that time.

10:49.900 --> 10:50.720
If I had killed him,

10:50.720 --> 10:52.580
I wouldn't have survived either.

10:56.840 --> 10:58.600
There was too little time.

11:01.650 --> 11:02.920
Then why don't we strike while the iron is hot

11:02.920 --> 11:03.720
and try again?

11:04.580 --> 11:05.450
This magic spell

11:05.450 --> 11:07.260
consumed a lot of energy.

11:07.510 --> 11:09.240
I'm afraid of being backfired.

11:09.390 --> 11:10.100
Besides, now,

11:10.100 --> 11:11.230
he must be prepared.

11:11.830 --> 11:13.630
If we rashly try again,

11:14.060 --> 11:14.670
it's also possible that

11:14.670 --> 11:16.070
we'll fall into his trap.

11:18.580 --> 11:19.170
I wonder

11:19.200 --> 11:20.530
if Banxia has returned.

11:22.960 --> 11:24.820
Why are you mentioning her again?

11:24.870 --> 11:26.000
Because I'm hungry.

11:26.150 --> 11:27.790
I haven't eaten anything today.

11:27.790 --> 11:29.290
I just confronted that demon for a long time.

11:29.290 --> 11:30.250
I'm starving.

11:31.480 --> 11:32.890
Aren't steamed buns filling enough?

11:32.890 --> 11:34.150
They don't taste good.

11:34.220 --> 11:34.820
I'm upset.

11:40.240 --> 11:41.300
Where has she gone?

11:45.220 --> 11:46.060
What did she

11:46.510 --> 11:47.820
buy today anyway?

11:50.860 --> 11:52.260
Let me tell you secretly.

11:52.550 --> 11:53.810
She told me not to tell.

11:54.590 --> 11:56.250
She bought hypostasis water.

11:57.870 --> 11:59.510
What does she need hypostasis water for?

11:59.510 --> 12:00.580
She doesn't even know how to use it.

12:00.580 --> 12:01.550
She knows how to use it.

12:01.550 --> 12:03.210
I taught her the incantation.

12:04.150 --> 12:06.880
How could there be any problem with what I taught?

12:19.030 --> 12:19.620
Banxia.

12:20.720 --> 12:23.850
Aren't we supposed to go to the East Market to buy fabric?

12:23.860 --> 12:24.910
Why are we here?

12:26.510 --> 12:27.100
I

12:27.750 --> 12:29.410
feel dizzy because of hunger.

12:29.840 --> 12:31.550
And if we don't head back soon,

12:32.200 --> 12:34.200
it'll be dark by the time we get back.

12:35.150 --> 12:35.790
How about

12:36.030 --> 12:36.610
we leave?

12:37.000 --> 12:39.130
Wait a little longer. A little longer.

12:39.150 --> 12:40.350
Just a little longer.

12:44.670 --> 12:46.170
When my father talked about the arrangements for our marriage,

12:46.170 --> 12:47.120
did he explain

12:47.150 --> 12:48.750
my situation to you clearly?

12:49.550 --> 12:50.810
He told us everything.

12:51.300 --> 12:52.300
Your father said,

12:53.270 --> 12:54.960
you're well-behaved, sensible,

12:54.960 --> 12:56.220
gentle, and virtuous.

12:56.510 --> 12:58.280
Although you're only two years younger than I am,

12:58.280 --> 12:59.200
you've read

12:59.230 --> 13:00.760
just as many books as I have.

13:01.120 --> 13:02.910
He even had our Four Pillars of Destiny compared

13:02.910 --> 13:03.440
and said

13:03.740 --> 13:04.400
the two of us

13:04.750 --> 13:05.950
are very compatible,

13:06.200 --> 13:07.460
a match made in heaven.

13:08.030 --> 13:08.790
He also said

13:10.080 --> 13:11.540
that after we're married,

13:11.630 --> 13:13.670
we'll surely live in harmony

13:14.150 --> 13:15.410
and grow old together.

13:16.620 --> 13:17.980
That's not what I mean.

13:21.750 --> 13:22.630
My left eye...

13:24.000 --> 13:25.730
You... You mean your hysteria?

13:26.240 --> 13:28.100
Your father mentioned that, too.

13:28.870 --> 13:29.440
Well,

13:29.510 --> 13:30.770
doesn't it bother you?

13:31.720 --> 13:33.320
I'm not that old-fashioned.

13:33.720 --> 13:34.910
Everyone gets sick

13:35.150 --> 13:36.670
at some point in their life.

13:36.670 --> 13:37.180
This isn't something

13:37.180 --> 13:38.040
we can control.

13:38.940 --> 13:40.270
Of course, I understand

13:40.480 --> 13:41.630
that as a young lady,

13:41.740 --> 13:43.000
you have many burdens.

13:43.360 --> 13:44.290
But don't worry.

13:44.600 --> 13:45.820
I will take good care of you.

13:45.820 --> 13:47.620
And I will never look down on you.

13:48.320 --> 13:49.890
It's not an illness.

13:50.550 --> 13:51.120
It's not.

13:51.390 --> 13:52.320
Absolutely not.

13:52.510 --> 13:54.630
The things I see are real.

13:54.630 --> 13:56.550
There are really demons in this world.

13:56.550 --> 13:58.330
Think carefully, how can someone

13:58.330 --> 13:59.660
come back from the dead?

13:59.760 --> 14:00.380
My father and the others

14:00.380 --> 14:01.860
were kidnapped by demons.

14:02.790 --> 14:04.720
I chased them all the way from Nanyang to Guangping.

14:04.720 --> 14:06.000
Although I had help from a master,

14:06.000 --> 14:07.390
it still took a tremendous effort

14:07.390 --> 14:08.550
to rescue them.

14:08.910 --> 14:09.390
This kind of thing,

14:09.390 --> 14:10.720
if it happens once, it can happen again.

14:10.720 --> 14:12.240
It may happen repeatedly.

14:12.510 --> 14:13.870
If we're married later,

14:14.030 --> 14:15.240
aren't you afraid that one day,

14:15.240 --> 14:17.170
those demons might kidnap you too?

14:18.910 --> 14:20.840
They told me a few days ago

14:20.840 --> 14:23.150
that your condition had greatly improved.

14:23.150 --> 14:24.550
Has it relapsed?

14:26.390 --> 14:27.600
But it doesn't matter.

14:27.600 --> 14:28.600
My word is my bond.

14:28.900 --> 14:30.270
I'm willing to face this with you.

14:30.270 --> 14:32.320
I won't break off the engagement because of this.

14:32.320 --> 14:33.480
I knew it.

14:34.550 --> 14:35.240
All right.

14:35.840 --> 14:36.480
Here.

14:38.440 --> 14:38.720
Take this.

14:38.720 --> 14:39.780
What are you doing?

14:41.080 --> 14:42.640
The Earth follows the laws.

14:42.670 --> 14:44.080
The essences of Yin and Yang are combined.

14:44.080 --> 14:45.550
Carry out all the laws and principles.

14:45.550 --> 14:46.670
Yin and Yang are just like a mirror.

14:46.670 --> 14:47.480
True forms swiftly appear.

14:47.480 --> 14:48.120
Appear quickly in your real shapes.

14:48.120 --> 14:49.050
Close your eyes.

14:49.320 --> 14:50.850
What... What are you doing?

14:53.870 --> 14:54.270
Banxia,

14:54.270 --> 14:56.380
I... I know I'm a good man.

14:56.670 --> 14:57.200
But...

14:57.670 --> 14:59.200
We can't do this now.

14:59.200 --> 15:00.470
-B-Because...
-Take it.

15:00.470 --> 15:01.700
There should be a certain degree of propriety in the interaction between men and women.

15:01.700 --> 15:03.080
And you haven't officially married into my family yet.

15:03.080 --> 15:04.010
Shut your mouth.

15:07.360 --> 15:08.030
Okay.

15:17.270 --> 15:17.780
Banxia!

15:17.960 --> 15:19.290
Spicy, spicy, so spicy!

15:19.440 --> 15:20.480
Hang in there for a bit. Hang in there for a bit.

15:20.480 --> 15:22.200
Open your eyes, open your eyes, open your eyes.

15:22.200 --> 15:22.750
Look, look, look.

15:22.750 --> 15:24.080
Look there, look there.

15:29.440 --> 15:30.170
Look at what?

15:31.750 --> 15:32.390
Nothing?

15:33.120 --> 15:33.670
What?

15:37.000 --> 15:38.480
The dosage isn't enough.

15:39.320 --> 15:41.050
Wait a moment. Let's try again.

15:41.840 --> 15:42.390
Banxia.

15:42.840 --> 15:43.390
Banxia, I...

15:43.390 --> 15:44.150
Hold this, hold this.

15:44.150 --> 15:44.670
Banxia.

15:44.750 --> 15:45.600
The Earth follows the laws.

15:45.600 --> 15:46.390
I... I don't know

15:46.390 --> 15:47.910
what exactly you're doing.

15:47.910 --> 15:48.390
I don't know

15:48.390 --> 15:49.000
what you're trying to prove either.

15:49.000 --> 15:49.720
But I think

15:49.910 --> 15:50.320
all matters

15:50.320 --> 15:51.150
can be solved

15:51.170 --> 15:52.120
through other ways, right?

15:52.120 --> 15:52.510
Banxia.

15:52.510 --> 15:53.440
-This will work.
-Banxia.

15:53.440 --> 15:54.700
Come on, hang in there.

15:56.630 --> 15:57.750
Help me hold this for a moment.

15:57.750 --> 15:59.080
I can't hold it anymore.

16:00.480 --> 16:02.240
The effect is too strong!

16:02.490 --> 16:04.200
Well, you need to open your eyes!

16:04.200 --> 16:05.030
Banxia!

16:05.360 --> 16:06.600
Well, you have to open your eyes!

16:06.600 --> 16:07.960
Open your eyes, open your eyes!

16:07.960 --> 16:10.360
Open... Open your eyes, open them!

16:10.500 --> 16:11.700
Look, look!

16:15.320 --> 16:16.320
Can you see it now?

16:17.240 --> 16:18.290
Is the threshold

16:18.320 --> 16:20.390
for enjoying the scenery so high nowadays?

16:20.390 --> 16:21.450
Still can't see it?

16:21.600 --> 16:22.670
What is there?

16:24.000 --> 16:24.860
I won't give up.

16:25.030 --> 16:26.120
Come on, hold this.

16:26.960 --> 16:27.720
Let's go all out.

16:27.720 --> 16:28.840
We'll succeed in one go.

16:28.840 --> 16:29.480
No, no, no.

16:29.750 --> 16:30.440
I see it.

16:31.080 --> 16:31.720
I see it.

16:32.030 --> 16:32.390
Come on.

16:32.390 --> 16:33.720
Here, here, here, here.

16:34.030 --> 16:34.990
I see it, Banxia!

16:35.150 --> 16:35.630
Banxia!

16:35.870 --> 16:36.870
I see everything!

16:37.510 --> 16:37.960
There.

16:38.200 --> 16:39.260
It's there, right?

16:39.270 --> 16:40.930
That's what you want me to see.

16:41.320 --> 16:42.150
It's there.

16:42.150 --> 16:43.150
It's everywhere.

16:43.480 --> 16:44.480
It's just like...

16:47.440 --> 16:48.120
It worked.

16:49.440 --> 16:50.080
Come on.

16:53.180 --> 16:54.120
Open your eyes. Open your eyes.

16:54.120 --> 16:54.630
Hang in there.

16:54.630 --> 16:56.160
Come back. Come back.

16:56.320 --> 16:57.440
Bear with it. Hang in there.

16:57.440 --> 16:58.700
Come on, come on, look.

17:07.790 --> 17:08.310
Fish.

17:09.480 --> 17:10.339
This is a demon.

17:12.200 --> 17:13.460
It's flying toward me.

17:37.880 --> 17:38.510
My Lady.

17:37.940 --> 17:42.230
[Qingche Hall]

17:38.880 --> 17:40.680
My Lady, why are you back so late?

17:40.920 --> 17:42.850
Master and Madam are worried sick.

17:43.000 --> 17:44.590
Young Master, Young Master.

17:44.590 --> 17:45.070
This...

17:48.310 --> 17:48.960
Ms. Duan,

17:49.240 --> 17:50.200
the young master...

17:50.200 --> 17:51.400
What happened to him?

17:52.420 --> 17:53.680
Nothing, he just fainted.

17:53.680 --> 17:54.790
Fainted? This...

17:56.130 --> 17:57.390
Young Master, wake up.

17:57.480 --> 17:58.280
Young Master.

17:59.030 --> 18:00.760
Where did you take him, My Lady?

18:01.030 --> 18:02.360
He's seen quite a sight.

18:03.720 --> 18:06.050
The young master had quite a shock today.

18:06.280 --> 18:07.240
You should take him

18:07.240 --> 18:09.240
to get some calming medicine later.

18:24.440 --> 18:26.300
You used hypostasis water on him?

18:27.590 --> 18:28.120
You should know

18:28.120 --> 18:29.550
how terrifying demons can be.

18:29.550 --> 18:31.200
Why did you reveal this to him?

18:31.200 --> 18:33.230
Aren't you afraid it might bring trouble?

18:33.230 --> 18:33.980
Then why did you

18:33.980 --> 18:35.410
reveal it to me back then?

18:36.710 --> 18:37.770
That's different.

18:38.110 --> 18:39.550
How is it different?

18:40.240 --> 18:41.130
I can see demons,

18:41.130 --> 18:42.110
but what about him?

18:42.110 --> 18:43.070
He's now going to marry

18:43.070 --> 18:44.530
a woman who can see demons.

18:44.640 --> 18:47.300
Should I keep it from him for the rest of his life?

18:48.310 --> 18:49.070
If a person

18:49.590 --> 18:50.310
doesn't know

18:50.310 --> 18:51.970
what kind of situation he's in

18:52.030 --> 18:53.720
and doesn't understand what he's facing,

18:53.720 --> 18:54.480
how can he make decisions

18:54.480 --> 18:55.740
that follow his heart?

18:56.510 --> 18:57.770
If I kept hiding it from him,

18:57.770 --> 18:58.480
I'd be depriving him of

18:58.480 --> 18:59.940
the right to make a choice.

19:00.000 --> 19:02.000
That wouldn't be fair to him either.

19:02.680 --> 19:03.810
The more thoroughly

19:04.080 --> 19:05.480
you see through some things,

19:05.480 --> 19:07.220
the more you will hurt yourself.

19:07.220 --> 19:08.050
Do you really think

19:08.050 --> 19:09.380
this is for his own good?

19:09.480 --> 19:10.340
What about you?

19:14.080 --> 19:14.790
Do you really think

19:14.790 --> 19:17.120
everything you've done is for my own good?

19:21.200 --> 19:22.880
At least I'm better than you.

19:24.780 --> 19:25.440
You didn't even give me

19:25.440 --> 19:26.900
the right to make a choice.

19:44.980 --> 19:45.540
My Lady,

19:45.720 --> 19:47.980
you said something really good just now.

19:49.110 --> 19:49.830
What?

19:52.480 --> 19:53.240
If a person

19:53.750 --> 19:54.640
doesn't know

19:54.640 --> 19:56.440
what kind of situation he's in

19:56.640 --> 19:57.510
and doesn't understand

19:57.510 --> 19:58.510
what he's facing,

19:59.100 --> 20:00.370
he can't make choices

20:00.400 --> 20:01.970
that follow his heart.

20:03.590 --> 20:04.920
What's so good about it?

20:07.040 --> 20:08.670
I think it's quite good.

20:28.340 --> 20:28.860
Mr. Bai,

20:29.240 --> 20:30.440
you played so well.

20:30.960 --> 20:32.200
It's been a long time since I've heard

20:32.200 --> 20:34.070
such exquisite music.

20:35.310 --> 20:36.030
Have a try?

20:37.960 --> 20:39.090
It's a pity, though.

20:39.970 --> 20:41.350
I haven't played for so long.

20:41.350 --> 20:42.960
My skills are quite rusty.

20:43.590 --> 20:45.070
Besides, I

20:45.090 --> 20:46.550
work all day with my hands,

20:47.000 --> 20:48.640
which are now rough and calloused.

20:48.640 --> 20:50.640
How can I possibly play the Qin well?

20:53.240 --> 20:55.040
Take another look at your hands.

20:55.540 --> 20:57.070
Are they the same as before?

21:05.790 --> 21:06.520
Give it a try.

21:40.480 --> 21:41.200
Sir.

21:42.470 --> 21:43.870
Have you seen this woman?

21:47.270 --> 21:48.310
I haven't seen her.

21:48.310 --> 21:49.710
Please think carefully.

21:51.580 --> 21:53.040
I really haven't seen her.

21:54.680 --> 21:55.640
Five li ahead

21:56.000 --> 21:56.860
is Shendu City.

21:57.350 --> 21:58.880
If you're looking for someone,

21:58.880 --> 22:01.440
you might want to check the Shendu Government.

22:01.440 --> 22:02.440
With some money,

22:02.640 --> 22:04.570
you might get what you want to know.

22:04.590 --> 22:05.790
Thank you for your trouble.

22:05.790 --> 22:06.720
You're welcome.

22:10.480 --> 22:11.380
Excuse me,

22:11.830 --> 22:13.490
have you seen this young lady?

22:14.030 --> 22:14.720
Well...

22:15.980 --> 22:17.040
I haven't seen her.

22:21.030 --> 22:22.160
Is this a young lady?

22:22.590 --> 22:23.270
She just dresses

22:23.270 --> 22:24.130
more like a man.

22:29.750 --> 22:30.730
Is that one?

22:39.440 --> 22:40.300
Sima Lingying!

22:41.680 --> 22:42.540
Sima Lingying!

22:44.790 --> 22:46.380
Sima Lingying! What happened?

22:46.380 --> 22:47.640
What's wrong with you?

22:50.310 --> 22:50.880
Demon.

22:52.720 --> 22:53.540
Demon.

22:58.000 --> 22:58.880
Sima Lingying!

23:08.570 --> 23:09.830
My Lady, you're awake.

23:12.270 --> 23:13.550
Li Xian is here again.

23:13.920 --> 23:16.050
He's waiting for you in the front hall.

23:16.230 --> 23:17.160
He's here again?

23:18.000 --> 23:18.920
He came here

23:18.920 --> 23:20.180
even though he's sick.

23:20.350 --> 23:21.350
His eyes

23:21.350 --> 23:22.550
gaze blankly at everything,

23:22.550 --> 23:23.750
as if he's possessed.

23:23.750 --> 23:25.150
It's quite frightening.

23:40.780 --> 23:41.170
Well,

23:41.190 --> 23:42.720
why do you keep gazing at me?

23:44.960 --> 23:45.350
Yes.

23:45.350 --> 23:46.880
I was reckless yesterday.

23:47.310 --> 23:48.440
But I didn't expect

23:48.440 --> 23:49.440
you to be so timid.

23:49.750 --> 23:51.080
You fainted right away.

23:51.750 --> 23:52.000
But

23:52.000 --> 23:53.750
I certainly didn't mean any harm.

23:53.750 --> 23:55.460
I just wanted you to see clearly

23:55.460 --> 23:56.310
and not to blindly

23:56.310 --> 23:57.110
get married.

23:57.510 --> 23:58.110
In the future...

23:58.110 --> 23:59.040
In the future...

23:59.720 --> 24:01.780
I will respect you even more, My Lady.

24:06.550 --> 24:07.510
I used to think

24:08.920 --> 24:10.180
that you had hysteria.

24:11.290 --> 24:12.040
Little did I know that I

24:12.040 --> 24:14.100
was the one who was truly beyond cure.

24:14.830 --> 24:15.480
My illness

24:16.110 --> 24:17.200
is ignorance,

24:17.480 --> 24:18.440
arrogance,

24:18.720 --> 24:20.780
and most of all, narrow-mindedness.

24:20.830 --> 24:21.510
Banxia.

24:22.270 --> 24:23.070
Thanks to you,

24:23.310 --> 24:24.240
I now know that in this world,

24:24.240 --> 24:25.070
there are actually demons,

24:25.070 --> 24:26.650
such mysterious creatures.

24:26.650 --> 24:27.740
Aren't you scared?

24:28.240 --> 24:29.040
Of course not.

24:29.440 --> 24:30.850
But you fainted from fright.

24:30.850 --> 24:32.640
I was just overwhelmed with excitement.

24:32.640 --> 24:33.400
To be honest,

24:33.710 --> 24:34.960
after I woke up this morning,

24:34.960 --> 24:36.560
I still couldn't believe it.

24:36.880 --> 24:38.680
I thought it was all just a dream.

24:38.750 --> 24:40.200
It wasn't until I asked my coachman

24:40.200 --> 24:41.930
that I realized it was all real.

24:48.350 --> 24:49.830
Look, the thing is,

24:51.710 --> 24:53.750
there are many types of demons in this world.

24:53.750 --> 24:54.790
Not all demons

24:54.790 --> 24:55.510
are like the fish demon

24:55.510 --> 24:56.600
we saw yesterday,

24:56.750 --> 24:58.270
which is kind and approachable.

24:58.270 --> 24:59.790
They often transform into human form

24:59.790 --> 25:01.590
and hide among people.

25:01.790 --> 25:02.960
When you're not paying attention,

25:02.960 --> 25:04.240
they'll skin you alive,

25:04.240 --> 25:05.240
break your bones,

25:05.510 --> 25:07.710
gnaw on your flesh, and suck your blood.

25:08.350 --> 25:09.000
Really?

25:10.590 --> 25:11.520
So you're saying

25:11.990 --> 25:12.920
those demons in storybooks,

25:12.920 --> 25:14.070
like fox demons, water demons, and painted skin demons,

25:14.070 --> 25:14.800
are all real?

25:15.960 --> 25:16.440
Banxia,

25:16.750 --> 25:17.960
did you see them before?

25:17.960 --> 25:19.200
Can they really speak like humans?

25:19.200 --> 25:21.260
Are they good at singing and dancing?

25:22.580 --> 25:23.380
Wait a moment.

25:33.620 --> 25:35.750
I've prepared pieces of paper and a brush.

25:35.750 --> 25:37.480
I want to record everything in detail.

25:37.480 --> 25:41.210
I'm going to write a book that is going to be famous around the world.

25:57.070 --> 25:57.930
Sima Lingying.

26:00.000 --> 26:00.440
Sir,

26:01.000 --> 26:02.790
could you drive the carriage more steadily?

26:02.790 --> 26:03.320
Alright.

26:03.880 --> 26:04.680
Hang in there.

26:05.100 --> 26:05.960
Once we reach Guangping,

26:05.960 --> 26:07.820
Xuanye will find a way to save you.

26:08.270 --> 26:09.330
Just hold on, okay?

26:29.310 --> 26:29.910
Youhuang.

26:30.510 --> 26:31.110
Excuse me,

26:31.880 --> 26:33.280
have you seen this woman?

26:33.630 --> 26:34.350
Let me see.

26:38.960 --> 26:40.090
I really don't know.

26:41.750 --> 26:42.200
No.

26:42.920 --> 26:44.450
Thank you for your trouble.

27:15.830 --> 27:16.350
Xuanye,

27:16.750 --> 27:18.310
I followed your advice

27:18.310 --> 27:19.480
and investigated Zhang Pu's wife.

27:19.480 --> 27:21.610
Sure enough, I found something suspicious.

27:21.610 --> 27:22.450
What is it?

27:23.250 --> 27:24.370
Do you remember

27:24.400 --> 27:25.440
that Lv Sanlang, who fell to his death

27:25.440 --> 27:27.740
in front of Xingxian's house several days ago?

27:27.740 --> 27:28.410
Yes.

27:29.140 --> 27:30.480
He was a drunkard and a lecher.

27:30.480 --> 27:31.960
He was even more despicable when drunk.

27:31.960 --> 27:33.360
When Zhang Pu was still alive,

27:33.360 --> 27:35.110
he didn't dare to harass Xingxian.

27:35.110 --> 27:36.440
But after Zhang Pu died,

27:36.750 --> 27:38.070
he became unrestrained.

27:38.070 --> 27:39.600
He often bullied Xingxian.

27:40.300 --> 27:41.410
Who told you this?

27:41.870 --> 27:43.670
The neighbors all know about it.

27:45.390 --> 27:46.720
What a coincidence.

27:47.720 --> 27:49.380
Zhang Pu often beat Xingxian.

27:49.750 --> 27:51.610
In the end, he died mysteriously.

27:51.650 --> 27:53.490
Lv Sanlang molested Xingxian.

27:53.680 --> 27:54.940
He also broke his neck.

27:55.460 --> 27:56.110
In the end, Xingxian

27:56.110 --> 27:57.630
also died inexplicably.

27:57.880 --> 27:59.210
And her body is missing.

27:59.830 --> 28:01.290
Are there any other clues?

28:01.790 --> 28:02.550
No.

28:03.860 --> 28:04.960
Although Zhang Pu and Lv Sanlang

28:04.960 --> 28:05.980
were neighbors,

28:06.110 --> 28:07.240
they weren't close.

28:07.440 --> 28:09.440
They had no previous interactions.

28:10.480 --> 28:11.350
Is there anything

28:11.350 --> 28:12.400
in common?

28:12.500 --> 28:13.230
For example,

28:13.400 --> 28:14.310
knowing the same people

28:14.310 --> 28:16.510
or frequently visiting the same place.

28:18.300 --> 28:19.510
However, I heard from the neighbors

28:19.510 --> 28:21.030
that they both loved drinking.

28:21.030 --> 28:22.880
They were both regulars at Liushui Pavilion.

28:22.880 --> 28:23.590
Whenever they made some money,

28:23.590 --> 28:25.320
they would go there to spend it.

28:38.240 --> 28:38.700
Banxia,

28:39.090 --> 28:39.720
the flying thing,

28:39.720 --> 28:40.980
what kind of fish is it?

28:41.090 --> 28:41.960
Are there demons

28:41.960 --> 28:42.760
on this street now?

28:42.760 --> 28:43.240
Can you use that potion

28:43.240 --> 28:44.300
on me one more time?

28:45.680 --> 28:46.590
Let me tell you,

28:46.590 --> 28:48.070
I'm definitely going to break off the engagement with you.

28:48.070 --> 28:49.350
I have someone I like.

28:49.370 --> 28:50.640
But that person is not you.

28:50.640 --> 28:51.640
If you're sensible,

28:51.640 --> 28:52.790
you should cancel the engagement quickly.

28:52.790 --> 28:54.140
We'll both save face.

28:54.550 --> 28:55.720
If you're not sensible,

28:55.720 --> 28:57.440
don't blame me for being ruthless.

28:57.440 --> 28:58.500
Do you understand?

29:01.830 --> 29:02.640
Mr. Bai?

29:05.200 --> 29:06.400
Please wait, Mr. Bai.

29:08.920 --> 29:10.650
I apologize for the intrusion.

29:10.810 --> 29:11.810
My surname is Jiu.

29:12.180 --> 29:14.510
I just heard your enchanting music.

29:14.950 --> 29:16.790
May I ask where you're from?

29:17.510 --> 29:18.030
You

29:18.550 --> 29:20.480
are also knowledgeable about Qin?

29:21.590 --> 29:22.270
Yes.

29:23.720 --> 29:25.200
That piece, "Drunk in the Misty Waves," I played just now

29:25.200 --> 29:26.200
is ordinary in techniques,

29:26.200 --> 29:27.830
and the artistic conception is hard to express.

29:27.830 --> 29:29.160
I was afraid I didn't handle it well

29:29.160 --> 29:30.960
to lose the farewell sentiment.

29:31.000 --> 29:32.530
I wonder what you think of it

29:32.920 --> 29:34.450
after you heard it just now.

29:35.750 --> 29:36.680
It's excellent.

29:37.070 --> 29:38.510
The feeling of parting with a friend

29:38.510 --> 29:40.370
was fully expressed in the music.

29:42.330 --> 29:43.880
You can't even tell the difference

29:43.880 --> 29:45.350
between "Evening Fishing Ballad" and "Drunk in the Misty Waves."

29:45.350 --> 29:47.030
You must rarely listen to such music,

29:47.030 --> 29:49.960
or perhaps you don't understand music theory at all.

29:50.240 --> 29:52.170
What exactly are your intentions?

29:52.350 --> 29:54.150
You might as well speak plainly.

29:56.240 --> 29:56.880
Mr. Bai.

30:06.510 --> 30:07.910
If there's nothing else,

30:08.270 --> 30:09.330
I'll take my leave.

30:14.790 --> 30:15.440
Xuanye.

30:16.230 --> 30:17.830
Xuanye, where are you going?

30:22.200 --> 30:23.260
You know what he is.

30:28.720 --> 30:29.980
I suspect he's a demon.

30:30.480 --> 30:31.110
Since you don't want

30:31.110 --> 30:32.370
to tell me what you saw,

30:32.830 --> 30:34.440
I'll have to go confirm it myself.

30:34.440 --> 30:35.640
After you confirm it,

30:35.920 --> 30:37.120
what do you plan to do?

30:38.590 --> 30:39.720
That's my business.

30:40.480 --> 30:41.510
He didn't do anything.

30:41.510 --> 30:42.970
Why do you want to kill him?

30:44.270 --> 30:45.060
When did I say

30:45.090 --> 30:46.350
I was going to kill him?

30:47.030 --> 30:48.000
And how do you know

30:48.000 --> 30:49.260
he didn't do anything?

30:53.440 --> 30:55.000
I can't even judge

30:55.030 --> 30:56.550
whether a demon is good or evil.

30:56.550 --> 30:57.840
How can you tell?

31:01.640 --> 31:03.240
Are you two talking about...

31:07.160 --> 31:07.960
You know him?

31:10.550 --> 31:11.550
Take me to see him.

31:12.810 --> 31:13.340
Alright.

31:18.140 --> 31:18.600
Xuanye,

31:19.200 --> 31:20.200
this is the place.

31:20.790 --> 31:22.200
Mr. Bai excels in playing the Qin,

31:22.200 --> 31:23.330
but he likes to lead a tranquil life,

31:23.330 --> 31:24.510
having an aversion to a lively and bustling environment.

31:24.510 --> 31:26.370
If he's willing to go to Shendu...

31:27.900 --> 31:28.360
Banxia,

31:28.750 --> 31:29.550
isn't this...

31:44.070 --> 31:44.650
Mr. Bai.

31:55.070 --> 31:55.740
These two

31:56.240 --> 31:57.100
are my friends.

31:57.480 --> 31:58.280
Good friends.

31:58.550 --> 32:00.070
They also admire you very much,

32:00.070 --> 32:02.400
so they came specially to visit you today.

32:03.670 --> 32:04.670
I didn't expect

32:04.770 --> 32:05.590
there was a Qin master like you

32:05.590 --> 32:06.480
in Guangping.

32:07.070 --> 32:08.480
I'm truly ignorant.

32:09.240 --> 32:10.720
I don't socialize much,

32:11.160 --> 32:13.030
so many people don't know me.

32:14.160 --> 32:16.020
Mr. Bai, you're being too modest.

32:16.310 --> 32:17.410
Today, I heard

32:17.440 --> 32:18.570
your heavenly music

32:18.680 --> 32:20.010
and didn't have my fill.

32:20.480 --> 32:22.280
I wonder if I might have the honor

32:22.370 --> 32:23.770
of listening to it again.

32:24.510 --> 32:25.590
I remember you

32:25.960 --> 32:27.760
don't understand music theory.

32:28.630 --> 32:29.690
It's true, I don't,

32:29.920 --> 32:31.120
but beautiful things

32:31.140 --> 32:32.640
can always be appealing and resonate with people,

32:32.640 --> 32:33.300
can't they?

32:33.890 --> 32:35.600
I go to Liushui Pavilion every month

32:35.600 --> 32:36.750
to play for seven days.

32:36.750 --> 32:38.200
If you want to listen,

32:38.750 --> 32:40.810
why don't you go to Liushui Pavilion?

32:42.200 --> 32:43.600
I want to listen to it now.

32:52.030 --> 32:52.580
Mr. Bai,

32:52.890 --> 32:53.970
I'd like to, too.

32:54.260 --> 32:55.450
Why don't you agree?

33:09.750 --> 33:10.510
Exquisite.

33:11.920 --> 33:12.680
Marvelous.

33:13.750 --> 33:15.110
I can even hear a bit of

33:15.110 --> 33:16.590
feminine grace in it.

33:18.030 --> 33:20.090
It's really an incredible artistry.

33:23.980 --> 33:25.610
Maybe I was mistaken.

33:26.110 --> 33:26.760
Indeed.

33:27.030 --> 33:29.630
How could there be so many demons in this world?

33:29.750 --> 33:31.080
You care about him a lot.

33:32.200 --> 33:33.000
No,

33:33.310 --> 33:35.770
I just don't think he seems like a bad person.

33:35.960 --> 33:37.550
And didn't Li Xian also say

33:37.880 --> 33:39.020
that he is

33:39.040 --> 33:41.480
a Qin master who's indifferent to fame and fortune?

33:41.480 --> 33:43.140
Yes, he's an absolute master.

33:44.690 --> 33:46.290
You still don't understand.

33:47.590 --> 33:48.990
What don't I understand?

33:50.170 --> 33:51.030
What I've said all along,

33:51.030 --> 33:52.070
the difference between human beings and demons,

33:52.070 --> 33:54.270
doesn't just refer to the fact that they're two different species.

33:54.270 --> 33:55.310
Their lifespans,

33:55.510 --> 33:56.400
abilities,

33:56.640 --> 33:58.160
backgrounds, and experiences also differ.

33:58.160 --> 33:59.350
All these determine that

33:59.350 --> 34:00.350
here is different

34:00.510 --> 34:02.370
between human beings and demons.

34:02.680 --> 34:04.000
The evil in the eyes of human beings

34:04.000 --> 34:04.800
is very likely

34:05.000 --> 34:06.070
to be the most ordinary thing

34:06.070 --> 34:07.510
in the world of demons.

34:08.320 --> 34:09.550
And what human beings despise

34:09.550 --> 34:10.590
is also very likely

34:10.590 --> 34:12.320
to be exactly what demons like.

34:12.670 --> 34:13.400
Therefore,

34:13.880 --> 34:15.880
the difference in standards for good and evil

34:15.880 --> 34:16.810
determines that

34:17.030 --> 34:18.480
the ultimate outcome for human beings and demons

34:18.480 --> 34:19.540
will be different.

34:20.300 --> 34:21.030
Banxia,

34:21.440 --> 34:23.100
if you don't understand this,

34:23.100 --> 34:25.300
you'll eventually be harmed by demons.

34:27.030 --> 34:29.159
We can't generalize like that, can we?

34:30.280 --> 34:33.070
Necessary restrictions are imposed on the demon clan.

34:33.070 --> 34:34.780
Demons who harm or hurt people

34:34.960 --> 34:37.060
will be expelled from the human world, and their primordial spirits will be taken away.

34:37.060 --> 34:38.590
Is this also generalizing?

34:39.280 --> 34:40.440
What did I do wrong?

34:41.440 --> 34:43.699
I just don't think it needs to go that far.

34:44.110 --> 34:44.690
Can't human beings and demons

34:44.690 --> 34:46.250
coexist peacefully?

34:46.670 --> 34:47.360
What about you?

34:47.360 --> 34:48.320
Aren't you still keeping Chi Xue

34:48.320 --> 34:49.280
by your side?

34:49.840 --> 34:50.920
It's different.

34:52.190 --> 34:52.630
Well,

34:53.360 --> 34:54.670
may I interject?

34:55.070 --> 34:57.800
Are you saying Mr. Bai is a demon?

35:00.070 --> 35:01.070
That makes sense.

35:01.280 --> 35:02.360
I was always puzzled

35:02.360 --> 35:04.000
about the reason why his music

35:04.000 --> 35:05.360
is so captivating

35:05.380 --> 35:06.450
and unique.

35:07.030 --> 35:07.890
If he's a demon,

35:07.960 --> 35:09.620
then everything makes sense.

35:11.250 --> 35:12.940
Aren't there any exceptions?

35:15.480 --> 35:17.140
Have you forgotten Manniang?

35:17.150 --> 35:18.210
And Chi Wangchuan?

35:18.620 --> 35:19.550
Have you forgotten what the Dream Demon did

35:19.550 --> 35:20.280
to make your parents

35:20.280 --> 35:21.760
be separated for over a decade against their will,

35:21.760 --> 35:24.840
which led to the fact that they almost couldn't meet in the end?

35:24.840 --> 35:26.440
Can you forgive all of these?

35:31.970 --> 35:32.550
There's something

35:32.550 --> 35:34.080
I'm not sure if I should ask.

35:34.630 --> 35:35.320
Banxia,

35:36.200 --> 35:36.960
you told me before

35:36.960 --> 35:37.710
that you wanted to break off our engagement

35:37.710 --> 35:38.440
because you

35:38.440 --> 35:39.700
have someone you like.

35:40.070 --> 35:40.880
Is that person

35:42.110 --> 35:43.190
Xuanye?

35:51.320 --> 35:52.320
It really is, huh?

35:53.920 --> 35:54.710
Well, I

35:56.670 --> 35:58.730
certainly have a good eye for people.

35:58.800 --> 35:59.730
Xuanye, you see,

35:59.960 --> 36:01.150
I admire you so much,

36:01.320 --> 36:02.530
and my fiancée

36:02.670 --> 36:03.870
is also so fond of you.

36:04.750 --> 36:05.630
Your personal charm

36:05.630 --> 36:06.590
is indeed evident to all.

36:06.590 --> 36:07.900
The two of us are truly destined to meet,

36:07.900 --> 36:08.460
Xuanye.

36:08.590 --> 36:09.670
We should've become

36:09.670 --> 36:10.600
sworn brothers.

36:10.710 --> 36:13.110
But you didn't listen to what I said before.

36:13.670 --> 36:15.260
What nonsense are you talking about?

36:15.260 --> 36:17.030
Who... Who is your fiancée?

36:17.770 --> 36:18.980
You should talk less.

36:23.800 --> 36:24.840
Why is she angry?

36:25.400 --> 36:25.990
In principle,

36:25.990 --> 36:27.470
I should be the angry one.

36:29.480 --> 36:29.960
Xuanye.

36:31.070 --> 36:31.710
Xuanye.

36:32.320 --> 36:33.590
I'm not really angry.

36:33.880 --> 36:34.400
Xuanye.

36:34.510 --> 36:35.640
Xuanye, wait for me.

36:37.060 --> 36:37.730
Mr. Bai.

36:40.350 --> 36:42.190
He seems to be from the government.

36:42.190 --> 36:43.520
He came to find me before

36:43.550 --> 36:44.840
to ask about the matter regarding Zhang Pu.

36:44.840 --> 36:45.700
The government

36:45.960 --> 36:47.440
doesn't have such a master.

36:47.440 --> 36:48.110
Master?

36:49.510 --> 36:50.590
I'm afraid he has already seen through

36:50.590 --> 36:51.510
my background.

36:52.510 --> 36:53.710
What should we do now?

36:54.880 --> 36:56.710
We don't need to fear him on normal days,

36:56.710 --> 36:57.710
but if he connects

36:57.710 --> 36:59.390
these recent cases together,

36:59.920 --> 37:01.520
there might be some trouble.

37:01.710 --> 37:02.400
Well,

37:03.430 --> 37:04.430
for the next days,

37:04.860 --> 37:07.320
you go to Liushui Pavilion to play in my place.

37:07.320 --> 37:08.030
Me?

37:10.070 --> 37:10.780
They probably

37:10.780 --> 37:12.040
won't let it go easily.

37:12.190 --> 37:14.030
They'll keep watching us for a while longer.

37:14.030 --> 37:15.000
When the time comes, I'll use spiritual power

37:15.000 --> 37:16.510
to make you look more like me.

37:16.510 --> 37:19.000
But the magic spell can only last for two hours.

37:19.000 --> 37:20.200
You're a human being.

37:20.480 --> 37:22.140
They can't do anything to you.

37:24.270 --> 37:34.950
[Ganshan Clinic]

37:33.360 --> 37:33.880
Xuanye!

37:34.480 --> 37:35.030
Xuanye!

37:36.550 --> 37:37.150
What's up?

37:37.320 --> 37:38.000
As you said,

37:38.480 --> 37:39.320
I found Sima Lingying

37:39.320 --> 37:40.190
near Shendu.

37:40.280 --> 37:41.210
Please save her.

37:46.510 --> 37:47.030
When I encountered her

37:47.030 --> 37:48.230
on the official road,

37:48.590 --> 37:49.360
she fainted.

37:49.960 --> 37:51.760
She mentioned there was a demon.

37:53.400 --> 37:54.800
How is her condition now?

37:57.840 --> 37:58.770
You go out first.

38:00.770 --> 38:01.230
Chi Xue,

38:01.440 --> 38:02.370
you go out first.

38:03.190 --> 38:04.390
You both go out first.

38:05.190 --> 38:05.990
Including me?

38:07.070 --> 38:07.800
Both of you.

38:19.190 --> 38:20.070
Close the door.

38:29.860 --> 38:30.460
Alright,

38:30.960 --> 38:32.490
stop pretending like that.

38:39.760 --> 38:41.360
You're really something, Physician Jiu.

38:41.360 --> 38:42.820
How did you see through it?

38:44.360 --> 38:45.960
People involved in a situation are often blind to its true nature.

38:45.960 --> 38:47.280
This little trick of yours

38:47.280 --> 38:48.740
can only work on Youhuang.

38:50.550 --> 38:51.110
Tell me,

38:51.800 --> 38:53.730
how were you captured by the demon?

38:53.960 --> 38:55.420
I want to know the details.

38:57.060 --> 38:58.080
That day, I was in Shendu

38:58.080 --> 38:59.340
going out on business.

38:59.370 --> 39:00.660
I happened to run into a demon

39:00.660 --> 39:02.520
who was in conflict with someone.

39:02.960 --> 39:04.370
His actions were ruthless,

39:04.370 --> 39:06.010
clearly beyond human capability at a glance.

39:06.010 --> 39:06.530
I...

39:09.640 --> 39:11.120
I'm a bit thirsty.

39:11.150 --> 39:13.010
Could you pour me a glass of water?

39:23.510 --> 39:24.370
What happened?

39:26.670 --> 39:28.030
Xuanye said she was trapped by a demon

39:28.030 --> 39:28.950
near Shendu,

39:29.590 --> 39:30.510
so I headed towards Shendu,

39:30.510 --> 39:31.910
searching along the way.

39:32.000 --> 39:33.420
Who knew that before entering the city,

39:33.420 --> 39:34.230
I found her fainted

39:34.230 --> 39:37.030
on the official road in Xiang County's territory?

39:37.340 --> 39:39.020
You were near Shendu.

39:39.280 --> 39:41.400
Why did you come all the way to Guangping?

39:41.400 --> 39:42.220
To deal with matters involving demons,

39:42.220 --> 39:43.710
I must certainly find Xuanye.

39:43.710 --> 39:46.150
Ordinary clinics can't deal with these matters.

39:46.150 --> 39:46.690
Moreover,

39:46.690 --> 39:48.070
if I had sent her back to Shendu

39:48.070 --> 39:49.590
and that demon had come after her,

39:49.590 --> 39:51.720
how would I be supposed to deal with it?

39:53.720 --> 39:54.670
Right.

39:55.750 --> 39:56.710
I didn't realize

39:56.840 --> 39:58.170
you were so thoughtful.

39:59.150 --> 40:00.000
Am I?

40:08.650 --> 40:10.720
I used the insect oil Youhuang gave me.

40:10.720 --> 40:11.870
I intended to lure the demon away

40:11.870 --> 40:12.880
and capture it in one fell swoop.

40:12.880 --> 40:13.810
But in the end...

40:15.440 --> 40:16.840
It turned out as you saw.

40:17.550 --> 40:18.750
I underestimated it.

40:20.480 --> 40:21.610
What happened next?

40:21.840 --> 40:23.400
Later, he recognized the insect oil.

40:23.400 --> 40:25.000
So he guessed that I knew you.

40:25.130 --> 40:26.090
He then tried every possible way

40:26.090 --> 40:28.290
to force me to reveal your whereabouts.

40:29.880 --> 40:30.840
He's after you.

40:32.340 --> 40:33.920
I've brought trouble upon you.

40:33.920 --> 40:34.550
I'm sorry.

40:34.840 --> 40:36.280
What do you mean by trouble?

40:36.280 --> 40:37.480
You saved my life.

40:37.760 --> 40:38.490
Besides,

40:38.590 --> 40:40.720
didn't you also save Youhuang's life?

40:44.240 --> 40:46.770
I'll resolve this matter as soon as possible.

40:47.870 --> 40:49.470
But you must be very careful.

40:49.840 --> 40:51.190
That demon is powerful.

40:51.960 --> 40:53.560
He's difficult to deal with.

40:54.280 --> 40:55.030
I know.

40:56.480 --> 40:58.340
I know you're used to being alone,

40:58.480 --> 40:59.480
but there are some things

40:59.480 --> 41:01.180
you shouldn't try to handle all by yourself.

41:01.180 --> 41:02.580
If you can't handle this,

41:03.180 --> 41:04.360
I can ask people from the government office

41:04.360 --> 41:05.000
to help.

41:06.800 --> 41:08.360
I appreciate your kindness,

41:08.360 --> 41:09.280
but that won't be necessary.

41:09.280 --> 41:09.840
Alright.

41:10.210 --> 41:11.540
Given what you said,

41:11.980 --> 41:12.800
you must have acknowledged

41:12.800 --> 41:13.840
this favor.

41:14.710 --> 41:15.770
So, can you help me?

41:20.190 --> 41:20.710
Come in.

41:27.360 --> 41:28.000
How is she?

41:29.280 --> 41:30.550
She was poisoned by demon poison.

41:30.550 --> 41:32.040
She needs someone with strong Yang energy

41:32.040 --> 41:33.790
to take care of her closely for 21 days.

41:33.790 --> 41:35.630
Only then can the poison be neutralized.

41:35.630 --> 41:37.590
It's best not to leave her side at all,

41:37.590 --> 41:39.450
whether you eat, drink, or sleep.

41:40.800 --> 41:42.860
I have to be with her even when I sleep?

41:42.880 --> 41:44.080
Is there such poison?

41:44.710 --> 41:45.440
Yes, indeed.

41:45.710 --> 41:47.190
I only learned about it

41:47.190 --> 41:48.360
after I met her.

41:49.190 --> 41:50.150
Aren't there other ways

41:50.150 --> 41:50.900
to neutralize the poison?

41:50.900 --> 41:51.840
No, there aren't.

41:51.840 --> 41:52.400
It's not convenient to take care of her

41:52.400 --> 41:53.360
in my place.

41:53.550 --> 41:54.950
You should take her home.

41:56.840 --> 41:57.480
Me?

41:58.000 --> 41:58.760
Didn't I tell you?

41:58.760 --> 41:59.210
It's not convenient to take care of her

41:59.210 --> 41:59.940
in my place.

42:00.440 --> 42:00.960
Come on.

42:14.550 --> 42:15.230
Thank you.

42:38.800 --> 42:40.030
Can I really do it?

42:41.640 --> 42:42.570
If you don't try,

42:43.400 --> 42:45.330
how can you know it's not possible?

42:59.190 --> 42:59.790
Remember,

43:00.070 --> 43:02.000
the magic spell can only last for two hours.

43:02.000 --> 43:03.800
Be careful in everything you do.

43:07.640 --> 43:08.160
Mr. Bai,

43:08.440 --> 43:09.840
you've come early today.

43:11.000 --> 43:11.660
Hello, Sir.

43:12.110 --> 43:12.800
Please.

43:50.230 --> 43:51.510
Mr. Bai's Qin skills are truly amazing.

43:51.510 --> 43:53.030
They make people feel as if they are in a fairyland

43:53.030 --> 43:54.800
and completely immersed in the music.

43:54.800 --> 43:55.230
Great!

43:55.590 --> 43:57.000
Great!

43:57.320 --> 44:00.960
Great! Great! Great!
